==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Zackie Peng]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.
*2 [[Zuche]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*2 [[Metal Hippoe]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*3 [[Zollow]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Lord Gravey]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Super Metal Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
**5 [[Metal Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
**5 [[Zuche]]s spawn, delay 53.33~56.67 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,700f</sup>.
**8 [[Zollow]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
**2 [[Zollow]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Don't focus on bringing too many critters for this stage, just bringing something like [[Volley Cat (Rare Cat)|Curry Cat]] and [[Cheerleader Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Soba Cat]] can do. The main idea of this stage is to stack wavers like [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Macho Legs]] and [[Hermit Cat (Special Cat)|Masked Grandmaster Cat]] on the Super Metal Hippoes to chip down Gravey and fend off the Zollows.

During the startoff, do not spawn Soba or anything that will kill the Metal Hippoes too quickly. You want to stack LD or wave attackers such as [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]] or [[Nymph Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fiend Cat]] before hitting the base. Once the Metal Hippoes die, summon [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]] and use the Iron Wall as it hits the base to ensure that the Zollows will not instantly kill your stack. Housewife should keep the Gravey away, and Curry should be able to slow the Super Metal Hippoes. Bring [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Cadaver BearCat]] or [[Ancient Egg: N107 (Rare Cat)|Cat Chief]] to get rid of any Pengs or Zuches that sneak past your frontline. Your attackers should preferably have more than 250 range so that they will not die to Gravey if SMH is knocked back. Once the two SMHs are dead, the stage is won.

